  currentColor, so they take the strip's ink and stay sharp at any size.

  Usage: {% render 'promise-icon', name: 'india' %}
  Names: india, quality, cod, shipping, returns, fabric, whatsapp, sprig,
         lotus, leaf. An unknown name draws nothing.
{%- endcomment -%}
